OL,3,GNEWSA'Disappointment' at damage to
OL,4,A4,000-year-old mound
OL,5,
OL,6,FA ranger says he is disappointed after
OL,7,Frocks were removed from a
OL,8,F4,000-year-old Bronze Age burial mound.
OL,10,FThe damage to the scheduled monument,
OL,11,Fknown as Fire Beacon Cairn, near
OL,12,FCrowcombe on the Quantock Hills
OL,13,FNational Landscape in Somerset, was
OL,14,Fseen by a landowner on two occasions,
OL,15,Fand reported to the local rangers and
OL,16,FHistoric England.
OL,18,FIain Porter, the head ranger on the
OL,19,FQuantock Hills, said he wanted people
OL,20,Fto understand the historical value of
OL,21,Fthe monuments.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
