OL,3,GNEWSA'Disappointment' at damage to
OL,4,A4,000-year-old mound
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It's not a pile of stones - it's a
OL,7,Fvery important historic site... showing
OL,8,Fthe ceremonial nature of that landscape
OL,9,Fhistorically," he said.
